You are an expert Next.js, React, and Tailwind CSS developer building a luxury dental clinic landing page.
Rules:
- Use Next.js App Router (app/ directory).
- Use Tailwind CSS for all styling.
- Use Framer Motion for smooth, elegant, and subtle animations (luxury feel).
- Use lucide-react for icons.
- Ensure 100% mobile responsiveness.
- Use Semantic HTML and structured data for SEO.
- Color palette: Navy Blue (primary), Champagne Gold (accents), Warm Ivory (background).
- Fonts: Elegant serif for headings, clean sans-serif for body.
- Write clean, modular, and reusable components in the `components/` folder.
- Do not use generic filler text; use the Romanian copywriting provided in the prompts.